      {
        "id": "a1_008",
        "presentation": "authored",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "speaker_label": "朝倉美幸",
        "text": "「这一张是原排程，另一张刚改过，对吗？病房收到新安排了吗？患者的术前准备现在完成到哪一步？」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "outfit": "uniform",
        "hide_portrait": false,
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_008",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "a1_009",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_yui"
      },
      {
        "id": "a1_009",
        "presentation": "authored",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "speaker_label": "年轻护士",
        "text": "「是。手术室说他们都准备好了，一直催着送人。可是病房应该还没收到……准备情况我也还没核完。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "outfit": "uniform",
        "hide_portrait": true,
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_009",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "a1_010",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
