        "actor_id": "nurse_yui"
      },
      {
        "id": "a1_014",
        "presentation": "authored",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "speaker_label": "朝倉美幸",
        "text": "「先和病房确认患者本人、术式和术前准备的交接状态。没有确认完的就说没有确认完，别用『应该』两个字顶上去。」",
        "expression": "serious",
        "outfit": "uniform",
        "hide_portrait": false,
        "choices": [
